LOCATION:Wiseguys - Downtown SLC\, 190 South 400 West\, Salt Lake City
DESCRIPTION:Dan Soder is a stand-up comedian\, actor\, and radio personalit
 y known for his sharp wit\, grounded perspective\, and effortless storytell
 ing. His recent work continues to gain strong traction: his podcast\, Soder
 \, has quickly become a fan favorite\, and his YouTube special\, Dan Soder:
  On The Road\, continues that momentum\, now with more than 4 million views
  on YouTube. He is currently on the second leg of a 25-city national tour w
 ith Outback Presents. Dan will shoot his Netflix Special this Summer. From 
 2015 to 2023\, Soder co-hosted SiriusXM’s hit show The Bonfire alongside 
 Big Jay Oakerson\, cultivating a loyal audience through his quick humor and
  relatable voice. As an actor\, he starred for seven seasons as Dudley “M
 afee” on Showtime’s Billions\, with additional appearances on Inside Am
 y Schumer and Paradise PD. His film credits include Trainwreck and Drunk Pa
 rents. Soder’s stand-up career includes Not Special (Comedy Central\, 201
 6)\, a breakout appearance on Netflix’s The Standups\, and his 2019 HBO s
 pecial\, Son of a Gary.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/ev
 ent/dan-soder-23448/
URL:https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/dan-soder-23448/
